(F5 W1 U3: control_post 2 -yes on a control index without timesteps,
 manual Pro 6.258, after control_post_apply 1 -no: index 2 evaluates the
 post records (post_element_force history in 00.his: 3.2967033 in index 1,
 12.0879121 in index 2), = Professional 02-08-2026 (which evaluates them
 at such an index also with control_post 2 -no).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
geometry_line 1 0 0 1 0 0.01
geometry_line 2 0 0 0 1 0.01
geometry_line 3 0 1 1 1 0.01
bounda_dof 0 -geometry_line 1 -vely
bounda_dof 1 -geometry_line 2 -velx
bounda_dof 2 -geometry_line 3 -vely
bounda_time 2 0 0 1 0.02
post_point 0 0.5 0.5
post_element_force 0 0. 1. 0. 0. 0.5 0.
post_element_force_geometry 0 -geometry_line 1
control_timestep 0 0.1 0.5
control_timestep 1 0.1 0.5
control_post_apply 1 -no
control_post 2 -yes
control_print_history 0 -post_element_force_result 0 0
control_print_history 1 -post_element_force_result 0 0
control_print_history 2 -post_element_force_result 0 0
target_item 0 -post_element_force_result 0 0
target_value 0 12.0879121 1.e-6
